  "summary": "I am a Web Developer and a Programmer with experience usingobject-oriented design techniques and programming languages,including Microsoft.NET Technologies. Experienced with successfuldevelopment and maintenance of Web Application Development.Experienced in managing, coordinating and operating teams ondifferent projects. Passionate about learning new technologies,building skills and sharing knowledge. Experience and knowledgeof software design methodologies, information systems architecture,object-oriented design.\n\nRoles and Responsibilities: \n• Developed Reusable functionalities used for the Application.\n• Developing code and maintaining the quality of code using Codingstandards. \n• Interacting with onsite for getting the requirements clarified anddevelop accordingly in the development environment.\n• Develop, support, and maintain code to meet system requirements.\n• Design, develop and implement various business-relatedapplications.\n• Implemented specific initiatives and projects.\n• Ensure implementation of software applications and debugging.\n• Direct, guide and lead projects within the budget limits and ensurethat system design and specifications should reach the standards.\n• Ensure completion of projects in a timely manner. \n• Developed and implement data migration and data interfaceprocesses.\n• Involved in designing and deploying web applications using VisualStudio.\n• Updating, and writing the code with existing requirementsdocumentation.\n",
