    "description": "My recent work experience was responsible for designing and building webapplications in GreyTeak Technologies. My responsibilities are to design thefront end web pages and program the code to handle the applications at bothserver and client side. \n\nI recently received training at Actualize Coding Bootcamp, and while theytaught many valuable technical skills, what they excelled at was tempering mynatural curiosity and inclination to all things tech so that I could pursue newtechnologies with confidence.\n\nThe Senior Developer role responsible for in-house systems, diagnosinghardware and software issues, ensuring all other developers were overcomingany issues that stopped them from completing their assigned tasks.Completing all assigned tasks within assigned time limits.Interviewing Clients and discovering project requirements, breaking theserequirements down to create a quote and a project timeline. Allocating designand programming tasks to staff with the appropriate skill level.\n\nDeveloped an in-house framework to speed up project development times forgeneral client websites. This framework contained basic modules like CMS,Product Listing Systems, E-commerce, payment Gateways, Photo Galleries,Blogs and more. The base system could then be customised to meet theclients requirements.",
